# {R} (the color is chosen as it is activated), which casts Lightning Bolt. The sacrifice is a cost (CR 602.2, 605.3), so the Treasure
# is in the graveyard before the mana is spent, and from there it makes no mana: its mana ability works only on the battlefield (CR 602.2).

